{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 工具调用与MCP MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Function Calling 的基本原理是什么？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fundamental\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/fundamental</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a></p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请解释 Function Calling（工具调用）的基本原理，包括它的核心流程和各角色的职责分工。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Function Calling 是一套让大语言模型（LLM）以结构化方式调用外部工具（函数）的机制。它由 OpenAI 在 2023 年推出，目前 Claude、Gemini、Qwen 等主流模型都原生支持。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"核心原理\" dir=\"auto\">核心原理</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Function Calling 的本质是 <strong>\"模型决策、代码执行\"</strong> 的分工机制：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>开发者定义工具</strong>：用 JSON Schema 描述每个工具的名称、功能、参数类型和约束</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>模型判断意图</strong>：模型根据用户问题和工具描述，决定是否调用工具</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>模型输出结构化调用请求</strong>：生成包含 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">tool_calls</code> 的 JSON，指定函数名和参数</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>应用程序执行工具</strong>：宿主代码解析 JSON，真正执行函数调用</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>结果返回模型</strong>：工具执行结果塞回对话，模型生成最终回答</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 data-heading=\"完整流程（两轮对话模型）\" dir=\"auto\">完整流程（两轮对话模型）</h3>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">第 1 轮：\n  用户提问 + 工具定义 → LLM\n  LLM → 输出 tool_calls（不直接回答）\n  \n应用层执行：\n  解析 tool_calls → 执行真实函数 → 获取结果\n\n第 2 轮：\n  工具结果 → LLM\n  LLM → 生成最终自然语言回答\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"三个核心角色\" dir=\"auto\">三个核心角色</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>类比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>开发者</td>\n<td>编写工具 JSON Schema（\"职位说明书\"）</td>\n<td>HR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLM</td>\n<td>判断是否需要调工具，生成调用指令</td>\n<td>经理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用代码</td>\n<td>真正执行函数、访问网络/数据库</td>\n<td>员工</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>关键点</strong>：模型全程只输出结构化 JSON，不亲自执行任何代码，也没有直接访问网络的权限。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"代码示例\" dir=\"auto\">代码示例</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> json\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> openai <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> OpenAI\n\nclient <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> OpenAI<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 定义工具 Schema</span>\ntools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"get_weather\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"查询指定城市的实时天气，仅支持中国大陆城市\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"parameters\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"object\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"properties\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"city\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"城市名称，如'北京''上海'，不要带省份前缀\"</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"unit\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"enum\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"celsius\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"fahrenheit\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"温度单位，默认摄氏度\"</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"required\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"city\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 第一轮：让模型决定调用什么工具</span>\nresponse <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>chat<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completions<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4o\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    messages<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"北京今天天气怎么样？\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    tool_choice<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"auto\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\nmessage <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>choices<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>message\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 检查是否需要工具调用</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    tool_call <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    function_name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>function<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name\n    arguments <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>function<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"模型请求调用: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>function_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">(</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">)\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 应用层执行真实函数（模拟）</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get_weather</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>city<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> unit<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"celsius\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"city\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> city<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"temperature\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">25</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"condition\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"晴\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> get_weather<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">**</span>arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 5. 第二轮：将工具结果返回给模型</span>\n    final_response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>chat<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completions<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n        model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4o\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        messages<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"北京今天天气怎么样？\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"assistant\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_calls\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_call_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>tools\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>final_response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>choices<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 模型真的会执行函数吗？</strong><br>\nA: 不会。模型只生成结构化的 tool_calls JSON，真正的函数执行由应用层代码完成。这是面试中必须强调的核心设计。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 如果工具描述写得不清晰会怎样？</strong><br>\nA: 模型会\"瞎猜\"——传错误参数、选错工具、硬塞不匹配的输入。description 字段是模型判断的唯一依据，必须精确具体。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：模型自己执行了函数。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：模型只输出 JSON，执行是应用层的事。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：Function Calling 和 Prompt 工程里的工具调用是一回事。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：Function Calling 是模型原生输出结构化 JSON；Prompt 工程靠解析自然语言，格式稳定性差很多。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：一次 Function Calling 就能完成复杂任务。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：复杂任务通常需要多轮工具调用，甚至并行调用多个工具。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","headings":[]}